                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa934749-cf51-3d07-beed-351ec7f1948e",
                        "entry_id": "78628a55-5408-3287-80fa-d7a090b4fce4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to furnish"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6255d8bb-1a77-4ee1-aa9c-0409c2d36467",
                                "sense_id": "fa934749-cf51-3d07-beed-351ec7f1948e",
                                "text": "обставля́ть кварти́ру",
                                "translation": "to furnish a flat (an apartment)",
                                "english": "to furnish a flat (an apartment)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "55d5c9a2-7921-48a2-a393-ba5585363b68",
                                "sense_id": "fa934749-cf51-3d07-beed-351ec7f1948e",
                                "text": "Пото́м вошли́ в столо́вую с буфе́том, пото́м в спа́льню; здесь в полумра́ке стоя́ли ря́дом две крова́ти, и похо́же бы́ло, что когда́ обставля́ли спа́льню, то име́ли в виду́, что всегда́ тут бу́дет о́чень хорошо́ и ина́че быть не мо́жет.",
                                "translation": "They passed into the dining room, where there was a sideboard, then into the bedroom, where two beds could be seen side by side in the half dusk: it seemed as though the bedroom had been furnished in such a way that life there would always be happy and could never be anything else.",
                                "english": "They passed into the dining room, where there was a sideboard, then into the bedroom, where two beds could be seen side by side in the half dusk: it seemed as though the bedroom had been furnished in such a way that life there would always be happy and could never be anything else."
                            }
                        ]
